  "description": "Layers an app's secrets into IConfiguration, so code reads them like any other setting (IConfiguration, IOptions<T>, connection strings) without knowing where they came from. builder.AddGMSecrets() adds a local, gitignored appsecrets.json over appsettings, then the secret store named by the SECRETS_PROVIDER environment variable — Doppler, AWS Secrets Manager, Azure Key Vault or HashiCorp Vault, via GM.Secrets.Doppler / AwsSecretsManager / AzureKeyVault / Vault — with optional periodic reload for rotation.",
